---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact | RhyGPU" description="Contact links for RhyGPU projects and portfolio work.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="back" href="/">rhygpu.dev</a>

    <header class="post-header">
      <p class="kicker">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="post-title">Contact</h1>
      <p class="post-subtitle">Project links, public profile, and future contact details.</p>
      <p class="post-meta">No fake inbox. Public links first.</p>
    </header>

    <main class="prose profile-page">
      <p>
        Contact details can be added here. For now, GitHub is the primary public link.
      </p>

      <div class="contact-grid">
        <a class="contact-card" href="https://github.com/RhyGPU">
          <span>Primary public link</span>
          <strong>GitHub</strong>
          <p>Repositories, project history, and current source work.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="contact-card" href="/projects/">
          <span>Portfolio</span>
          <strong>Projects</strong>
          <p>Mnemosyne, OmniPlanner, Pythagorean Harmony, and future project pages.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="contact-card" href="/devlog/">
          <span>Development journal</span>
          <strong>Devlog</strong>
          <p>Public notes on architecture, failures, repair loops, and design decisions.</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <section>
        <p class="section-label">Site / project contact</p>
        <p>
          For now, use the GitHub profile as the public entry point. A direct email or formal contact method can be added later when it is ready to publish.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
